WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.866 --> 00:00:01.768
Oh, shit!

00:00:02.768 --> 00:00:04.003
-(HONKING)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:00:04.303 --> 00:00:06.239
-I'm going.
-Okay.

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:10.676
I'ma just circle around
the block one more time.

00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:12.545
♪ (HIP HOP MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:14.080
Has Molly said something to you?

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.482
-About what?
-She's been on my neck lately.

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:18.484
You'd tell me
if she was ugly, right?

00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:19.485
Girl, of course not.

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:20.720
(CHUCKLES)

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:23.423
When I am struggling,
my man gets it.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.124
I get that you have a lot
of work, but...

00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:26.559
I'm just trying to figure out
where I fit in.

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:29.128
That's my little angel
right here.

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:30.530
-You want to hold her?
-Uh...

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.131
I just dropped a burrito
earlier today...

00:00:32.231 --> 00:00:33.599
Then hell no.

00:00:33.932 --> 00:00:35.535
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

